    "enUS": {
      "description": "<Orokai closes his eyes and becomes perfectly still as he communes with the branch. You can feel the stinging prickle of magic on your skin as he does so.>\r\n\r\nOh my, little mortal. The tales this branch has to tell...\r\n\r\nCome, let me show you.",
